  "body": "good question, i use ART because of its jxl capability ... is there a way to log the errors or if it happens again, can i find anywhere informations about the state of the queue and post it here? If i understood the principle correctly, than Art exports the pictures in a uncompressed format like TIFF and the converts these pictures to jxl and so on.\nSo i can imagine, that the stopping of the queue is not really a stop, perhaps waits the queue for a response from the converter which does not respond?\n\nMy system is a notebook: 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1135G7 @ 2.40GHz (2.42 GHz), 16GB Ram, Win 11 home 25H2",
